{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>發佈時間：14:30 2026-10-28 HKT</p>\n<img alt=\"黃心穎慶祝結婚3周年放閃  與老公「泥鯭」黎萬宏幸福合照  家中做一事平淡度過\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/56e302e7f55d997dffc16616c1d2d89f/2026-10/Copy_of_Copy_of_KF_183.png\"/>\n<p>37歲的黃心穎昨日（27日）於社交平台大晒與老公「泥鯭」黎萬宏慶祝結婚3周年的甜蜜相片，黃心穎手執鮮花，一臉甜笑，並寫道：「It’s interesting to learn what each new anniversary is called. And here we are, happy “leather” anniversary （每個新紀念日是什麼名字都很有趣。現在我們在這裡，開心慶祝『皮革婚』。）」相中的她展現燦爛笑容，已完全走出陰霾，重回幸福軌道。</p>\n<h2>黃心穎穿皮褸迎結婚3周年</h2>\n<p>從黃心穎上傳的相片可見，兩夫妻的慶祝方式充滿儀式感又帶點幽默。泥鯭特意送上一束精美的粉色玫瑰，而黃心穎亦十分配合「皮革婚」的主題，特意穿上黑色型格皮衣與老公貼頭自拍，盡顯恩愛。除了「真鮮花」外，黃心穎更搞笑地手持一大棵生菜自拍，並幽默地標註為「Bouquet #2（第二束花）」，暗示這是一束最實用的「蔬菜花」，展現私底下活潑開朗的一面。</p>\n<img alt=\"黃心穎與「泥鯭」黎萬宏於2023年低調舉行婚禮。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/569f90c1f5e536d5f98df0556129c350/2024-10/Photo_by_Jacqueline_Wong_on_October_26_2024_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黃心穎曾在IG上分享了多張婚禮場內絕密花絮相片。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6f087aa77886bae3c5adb16df9d839f9/2024-10/Photo_by_Jacqueline_Wong_on_October_26_2024_7_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黃心穎以英文留言：「Happy Paperwedding. Thank you for being my rock.」，深情表白並多謝老公的支持與照顧，成為她如磐石般堅固的後盾。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/65afb6fa4a89b73a570637334b61d5c0/2024-10/Photo_by_Jacqueline_Wong_on_October_26_2024_7__0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"老公「泥鯭」黎萬宏精心準備精美鮮花送給黃心穎。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9d2499e6bbe9ed8ce4db977c2fee0579/2026-10/SaveClip_App_863428531_18643480090006608_2384100485362182821_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黃心穎與老公「泥鯭」黎萬宏穿上黑色皮褸貼頭自拍，恩愛非常。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b62f86a7e03214323952914f5f2be135/2026-10/SaveClip_App_865822405_18643480099006608_1446932355508883796_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黃心穎與「泥鯭」黎萬宏周年紀念回歸平淡，最愛在家中「打邊爐」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ed1dd457e87f1a2c7786549009e8663b/2026-10/SaveClip_App_866487311_18643480138006608_4485470633350752423_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黃心穎手持生菜，留言是老公「泥鯭」黎萬宏送的第二束花。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d2ebe627766344a59bd8c549f5f46adb/2026-10/SaveClip_App_867689231_18643480120006608_406191020495663745_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黃心穎與「泥鯭」黎萬宏親手餵飼兩隻寶貝愛犬，享受簡單幸福。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e9ff02191f9ed1dc426b3a4e0acfcade/2026-10/SaveClip_App_868037780_18643480168006608_8706918264590900138_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黃心穎曾與老公泥鯭去了馬爾代夫旅行，她在海邊與魔鬼魚合照，惟全程以T-shirt遮掩好身材。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c528493f4d12022ceaf6e85e4ac89a3f/2024-02/jacqueline_02.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黃心穎曾去了馬爾代夫玩浮潛，期間跟鯊魚一起暢泳，她笑言是「不能讓媽媽看到」系列照片。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/afd937802e0193ca28b19f719841826e/2024-02/jacqueline_01.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黃心穎在馬爾代夫旅行期間，貼出三點式日光浴照，盡晒健康小麥美腿與C cup豐滿上圍，而其身上的Versace黑色比堅尼盛惠3,700元。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/602086c50b88809844c0319c393f9168/2024-02/jacqueline_03.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黃心穎晒去馬爾代夫度假照片。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b39a92de52fe1fc04f0ab4c2f1b9bb32/2024-02/201_6.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"黃心穎去馬爾代夫旅行，心情非常之靚，臉上更流露出幸福笑容。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/797b83665356da1e36b113278c594e75/2024-02/202_5.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"黃心穎在馬爾代夫度假，她穿上火辣辣紅色比堅尼在沙灘上狂奔。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/596fdf962b3471f2acc0928f4b0ec800/2024-02/426136533_18413826850006608_5028695989019998225_n_0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黃心穎試過貼了一段短片，記錄了夫婦二人玩潛水時看到的水底世界。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/43735b77be878e45dd421b1042988f2a/2024-02/jacquelinebwong_1707740092_3301082984928383577_2182607_mp4_snapshot_00_01_807.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"一身健康膚色的黃心穎。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5eaadf4ceddff5e9ca86dadc736ff7aa/2024-02/jacquelinebwong_1707740092_3301082984928383577_2182607_mp4_snapshot_00_14_933.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"全程瘋狂潛水！\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/788fcb8856cf5f8b5adf858358b5b711/2024-02/jacquelinebwong_1707740092_3301082984928383577_2182607_mp4_snapshot_00_34_933.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黃心穎迷上潛水！\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ebdeb8c04b30534e78dd7e72ca3b141d/2024-02/jacquelinebwong_1707740092_3301082984928383577_2182607_mp4_snapshot_00_40_728.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黃心穎又曾分享遊關西Post，他們去了大阪地標glico固力果跑步人前打卡，黃心穎模仿跑步人雙手舉高，單腳屈膝站立，露出非常之開心的笑容。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8e191ee0c763fa3122df17ea08d3d7b4/2024-03/jacquelinebwong_432000630_18423006811006608_4322788810245156963_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"他們更去了清水寺的明保野亭。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/44ccd533399032b75d21c1b8e14f9eb2/2024-03/jacquelinebwong_429865010_18423006820006608_2123965617711975344_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黃心穎用手機向一個倒後鏡拍攝，兩人露出幸福肥及甜蜜笑容，她更表示：「兩個都食到圓晒」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/afd4a87caee52b665a5a2f19a5e1de89/2024-03/jacquelinebwong_429827632_18423006829006608_4438865591263664539_n_1.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"老公的視覺，低炒拍攝黃心穎的甜美笑容。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4c5ed2bd465cae2ed7c75c6e59e24290/2024-03/304_3.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"黃心穎在IG分享了多張在日本嘆茶的相片，並寫道：「飲料系列」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1996b25ccb7a72594dc4e08848e758a9/2024-03/jacquelinebwong_428690079_18422340409006608_6260971439340641202_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黃心穎情人節在IG出Po，晒出收12朵粉紅玫瑰花。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e3781d54d96f6a38c5927ba287c6cde3/2024-02/428166570_18415038016006608_8648488574402492647_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黃心穎自從與樂隊RubberBand鼓手泥鯭（黎萬宏）相戀後，兩人有影皆雙。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/57be31852ce4d74dccfdb8f91d4d2b77/2024-02/338427888_620058896651149_8666246524630818450_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黃心穎與泥鯭（黎萬宏）相戀後，兩人一直恩愛。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c270c1923bd5c3f6b8d8d97349a239e6/2024-02/414694228_18405958231006608_8738465909136567_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黃心穎貼上與老公的合照。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9eb89fbf3e53c48b946972c96676e2ad/2024-02/jacquelinebwong_1707740092_3301082984928383577_2182607_mp4_snapshot_00_45_567.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"大晒泳照！\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/82101b24a94b7b30c94e258bd8431c63/2024-02/jacquelinebwong_1707740092_3301082984928383577_2182607_mp4_snapshot_00_50_663.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"絕密床照曝光！\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/591b313df63cfea07414d5e6b49861e9/2024-02/jacquelinebwong_1707740092_3301082984928383577_2182607_mp4_snapshot_02_20_577.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"絕密床照曝光！\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5f07b4138e93c6a4f533df7a89efaace/2024-02/jacquelinebwong_1707740092_3301082984928383577_2182607_mp4_snapshot_02_28_378.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黃心穎蜜月之旅瘋狂享受一件事！\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9f22737ad6172d2867c29f1669500460/2024-02/jacquelinebwong_1707740092_3301082984928383577_2182607_mp4_snapshot_02_30_717.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黃心穎真的很愛潛水！\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a29f07ca3524f10ac86ad7d93c10096c/2024-02/jacquelinebwong_1707740092_3301082984928383577_2182607_mp4_snapshot_03_10_566.jpg\"/>\n<h2>黃心穎低調家中食火鍋慶祝</h2>\n<p>黃心穎與老公儀式過後，並沒有選擇到高級餐廳慶祝，反而回歸平淡，黃心穎晒出在家中食火鍋的相片，滾燙的鍋中放滿蔬菜，並配文寫道「Our fav」，還附上代表兩夫妻與兩隻愛犬的表情符號，她亦分享了親手餵飼兩隻寶貝愛犬食零食的溫馨畫面，彰顯出平淡是福。</p>\n<img alt=\"黃心穎是2012年香港小姐亞軍。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f5408b115bbd85ed57a0c89fb5837a42/2022-12/wongsumwing_ig_17.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黃心穎前年復出轉做歌手，在MV中的造型也比以往密實。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e91082acb3052c1721b7ba405f0ff5af/2023-04/unknown_332628952_591746505820892_2064238151741122859_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黃心穎於2023年與泥鯭在元朗戶外場地超低調成婚。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/139b4293bab022190795de3b6892e5cb/2024-08/jacquelinebwong_1725020642_3446045369950961447_2182607.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黃心穎曾於IG貼出為老公慶祝50歲生日的照片。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9b89cd2bf8cdb796b8868e66a27d242f/2024-08/jacquelinebwong_1725020642_3446045369950838449_2182607.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"另一張照片就見到黃心穎一臉情深望着正Chok樣的泥鯭。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5ad4d305d386464f3c97e0145dd877c7/2024-08/jacquelinebwong_1725020642_3446045369825172974_2182607.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黃心穎準備了幾款甜品代替生日蛋糕，並以英語發文寫道：「祝那位聲稱自己不像50歲的人生日快樂！我認同。」\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/478bfb30b6563c2b3e0ea11012b66f8a/2024-08/jacquelinebwong_1725020642_3446045370118578229_2182607.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黃心穎小腿上有新的玫瑰紋身。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ae7052b57e08d28c3ca8b7bb3377b50d/2024-09/461092084_18459850327006608_2060102888630699553_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黃心穎身穿黑色一件頭泳衣，因中門大開，逼爆的上圍非常之立體，加上一雙小麥色的美腿，極之搶fo。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/dcb76acb2742368938091e6938e13b6b/2024-09/461169397_18459850345006608_7328040999466303430_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黃心穎無懼走光，在沙灘上跳躍起來，上圍更加盪漾，震撼眼球！\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/81ffa1f3d933073c2ae4992859d13389/2024-09/461090608_18459850336006608_3465427528044174582_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黃心穎36歲生日舉家慶祝，老公泥鯭罕有留長了頭髮，形象跟以前截然不同。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b18955ad8a7adbb661f6ff83105e304d/2025-01/FF1.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黃心穎36歲生日，和兩位家姐和媽媽合照。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/cf6231b66122abeb971405c0f274f17f/2025-01/FF2.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黃心穎36歲生日，和兩位家姐合照。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3255836efae46b29b988b610ce730f47/2025-01/FF3.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黃心穎36歲生日，當然要許願。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/469e20224a686e2521fc93d3d2d54282/2025-01/FF4.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黃心穎36歲生日開心慶祝。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/67bbab6c8cf96e74c0c8db998e708640/2025-01/FF5.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黃心穎笑到見牙唔見眼。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8bcaeff989d1a0bc8178aabc8b0552e2/2025-01/FF6.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"早前黃心穎舉家飛日本旅行，亦陸續在IG上晒出多張風景靚相。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ebb8e577e73a724137b369c0c8ab87b7/2024-12/Photo_by_Jacqueline_Wong_on_December_04_2024_1_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黃心穎與老公泥鯭早前與黃心慧一家同遊東京，黃心穎亦在IG上分享出眾人在富士山下留影的照片。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b030a2ae5989ad2af5a1fb58e0f1de3a/2024-12/Photo_shared_by_Jacqueline_Wong_on_December_04_2024_tagging_waiwai1110_kcwlui_and_laimaa_n_5_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"早前黃心穎在IG上晒出多張與姨甥女「豆豆」的合照，並以英文留言：「日本的 Fam jam，很高興見到你們。日本永遠不會讓人失望！謝謝你」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/514eb26e1f08aaf33bc5ae9b584a323d/2024-12/Photo_by_Jacqueline_Wong_on_December_15_2024_2_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"其後黃心穎又同三家姐黃心慧及「豆豆」站在蜘蛛造型的藝術裝置下影合照，黃心穎更學蜘蛛一樣「張牙舞爪」，十分盞鬼。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1c7a53206b8852d089bacd4a43e596f1/2024-12/Photo_shared_by_Jacqueline_Wong_on_December_15_2024_tagging_waiwai1110_4_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"然後黃心穎亦有晒出同「豆豆」的單獨合照，可見黃心穎雙手托住姨甥女，低頭望住對方並露出甜甜的笑容。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9cb0e78bf4f3840f362b11fb77469163/2024-12/Photo_by_Jacqueline_Wong_on_December_15_2024_1_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黃心穎又緊緊攬住姨甥女，將頭部放在其背上，二人感情好到就如兩母女一樣，黃心穎恨做人母之心顯而易見。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e60245bfaf7a029897548a99e498741d/2024-12/Photo_by_Jacqueline_Wong_on_December_15_2024_2__0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黃心穎搭住黃心慧肩膀。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/72eb444f15e3767aab4ee2b50f253fb8/2024-12/Photo_by_Jacqueline_Wong_on_December_15_2024_1__0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"老公泥鯭都在場。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7da0a861b8ffc6e48d9dc7133eb2523d/2024-12/Photo_shared_by_Jacqueline_Wong_on_December_15_2024_tagging_laimaa_n_1_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黃心穎都有去神社祈福。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f488cf7eb0219bbe561b9f2a794deed6/2024-12/Photo_by_Jacqueline_Wong_on_December_15_2024_2__1.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黃心穎成爲人妻後幸福美滿。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0f3c13e4f7777dbdbf7090d6e57520d6/2024-10/Photo_by_Jacqueline_Wong_on_October_26_2024_2_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黃心穎貼出老公泥鯭（黎萬宏）踢水的背面照，更笑指，「呢張幾呃得吓人」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5ae5c8a93d034e9064ee7abef840ff21/2024-09/308_0.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"早前黃心穎在IG貼上到阿聯酋阿布扎比旅行的相片。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3a2c3615b93ad87d763d5caa7b7bbb44/2024-09/jacquelinebwong_1726726487_3460355036575170591_2182607.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"期間到訪有伊斯蘭聖堂之稱的謝赫扎耶德大清真朝聖。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d4b4197358e97969d8a87da958524593/2024-09/jacquelinebwong_1726726487_3460355036701140352_2182607.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黃心穎的身形有點圓潤，而且刻意用手袋或者雙手遮肚。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ed24a70f047e1b3dc8e73b23be1a79b8/2024-09/jacquelinebwong_1726726487_3460355036566921210_2182607.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黃心穎的身形有點圓潤，而且刻意用手袋或者雙手遮肚。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c890348213b16e8f519cb7713d401cf1/2024-09/jacquelinebwong_1726726487_3460355036575268232_2182607.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黃心穎的身形有點圓潤，而且刻意用手袋或者雙手遮肚。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b19fa46195e10622d9a8c3aaacd351b3/2024-09/jacquelinebwong_1726726487_3460355036709460640_2182607.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"其中一張大半身相更見孕味濃，於是有不少網民猜測黃心穎是否懷孕。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c93b06723d0a9c7fcc8946af40aa9b13/2024-09/jacquelinebwong_1726726487_3460355036877193913_2182607.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黃心穎與RubberBand鼓手泥鯭於2023年10月低調成婚。  ​\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7392725577dca3ff36b549882f4b9e40/2023-10/jacquelinebwong_1698472967_3223347334300507190_2182607.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"照片更見黃心穎與泥鯭甜笑對望，氣氛非常幸福。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/fcbb3f661447db542ae67d72d6f9453a/2023-10/jacquelinebwong_1698472967_3223347334308793263_2182607.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黃心穎爸爸見證女兒出嫁都非常感動，其中一張照片更拍下黃心穎與爸爸頭貼頭擁抱的感動一刻。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b383bff5eaec5a2f88f6a2eb7541563e/2023-10/shelbywong_1698480373_3223409459643428475_2130431.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黃心穎2023年10月升呢成為人妻。  ​\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f0ad712f6f3b65dec764becd4ae6f1f8/2023-11/WONG_1_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黃心穎復出後當上歌手。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c6fdb6cceac7ae7361a2e1b2556346d2/2024-01/jacqueline_02.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黃心穎復出做歌手。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/69bd380cb3fea210c0b46216f33afe7f/2023-12/jacquelinebwong_1704021558_3269892290326190334_2182607.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黃心穎早前晒RubberBand演唱會後台照。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/359061890510a61a6cb8638d8c4e1c63/2024-01/jacquelinebwong_1703560790_3266027090694981279_2182607.jpg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T07:01:12.941165+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":578,"images":72,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T06:30:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T10:58:50.460335+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T06:58:36.391427+00:00","content_hash":"2284ca28cb38b3933e407815d7304b9bb77c9d82ce09a40de7d5ebf134185c3b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}